The colors are defined in the code, but how they are displayed
is much more variable.

Amulet is HI_METAL, Bell is HI_SILVER, Book is HI_PAPER,
Candelabrum is HI_GOLD.

I take the Candelabrum as old since Vlad has had it for a
while, the Bell as new since it comes from outside of the
dungeon (sorta), the Book as borrowed since Rodney keeps
coming back trying to take it (along with other stuff)
away from you), and the Amulet is left as blue because
"metal" is arguably going to be displayed as blue on more
types of system than yellow/red gold, white/reflective
silver or blank/tan paper.

Of all of the options none are clear.  Your Quest artifact
is borrowed from your mentor but it is not needed
strictly speaking, leaving the Book as being "borrowed"
from Rodney because none of the other item-holders come
back after you kill them.

Fun stuff.



